  "description": "Drop-in authentication primitives for ASP.NET Core. JWT (HS256/RS256/ES256) with signing-key rotation, PBKDF2-SHA256 password hashing, refresh tokens, audit, lockout, TOTP, recovery codes, cookie + bearer + API-key schemes.",
